IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q01-WITHDRAWAL-LIMIT.
*> Checks withdrawal amount against 100 to 50000 limits.
*> Tests: 99, 100, 101, 49999, 50000, 50001, 0, -50, ABC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-RAW-INPUT        PIC X(15).
01  WS-DOT-CNT          PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.
01  WS-AMOUNT           PIC S9(9) VALUE 0.
01  WS-MIN-LIMIT        PIC 9(6)  VALUE 100.
01  WS-MAX-LIMIT        PIC 9(6)  VALUE 50000.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-RAW-INPUT
    INSPECT WS-RAW-INPUT TALLYING WS-DOT-CNT FOR ALL "."

    IF FUNCTION TEST-NUMVAL(WS-RAW-INPUT) NOT = 0
       OR WS-DOT-CNT > 0
        DISPLAY "INVALID INPUT"
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    COMPUTE WS-AMOUNT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-RAW-INPUT)

    IF WS-AMOUNT < WS-MIN-LIMIT OR WS-AMOUNT > WS-MAX-LIMIT
        DISPLAY "REJECTED"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "ACCEPTED"
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
